    "detailed_description": "<h1>Save more with bundle!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/88556f4d2b38b624b82db2de8496aa25.avif?t=1754654978\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to step into the shoes of a packaging expert? In <strong>Ship, Inc.</strong>, you take on the role of a packaging employee at a fast-paced cargo shipment company. Your job? Sort, package, and ship parcels to their correct destinations while keeping up with the growing demands of the business.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1b99b1b2cce302b5fb340f576f391e50.poster.avif?t=1754654978\" width=790 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1b99b1b2cce302b5fb340f576f391e50.webm?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1b99b1b2cce302b5fb340f576f391e50.mp4?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How It Works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Ship, Inc., every package counts! Follow shipment orders carefully, choose the right box sizes, and ensure each package reaches its destination safely. Misplacing or damaging shipments could cost you, so be precise and efficient!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1ca9eb3742160d49f947fc1d1c607797.poster.avif?t=1754654978\" width=800 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1ca9eb3742160d49f947fc1d1c607797.webm?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1ca9eb3742160d49f947fc1d1c607797.mp4?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Cozy &amp; Wholesome Packaging System</strong> \u2013 Select the correct box size, arrange items properly, and seal them securely before shipping.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccb <strong>Order Processing</strong> \u2013 Keep an eye on incoming orders and ship parcels correctly to maximize efficiency.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Upgrade Your Office</strong> \u2013 Earn money to improve your workspace, increase storage, and unlock better shipping tools.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Time Management Challenges</strong> \u2013 Stay on top of customer demands as you balance speed and accuracy in your shipments.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Deliver With Care</strong> \u2013 Packages must be handled properly! Fragile items require extra attention to avoid damage during transit.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Dynamic Difficulty</strong> \u2013 As you progress, new challenges and complex orders will test your multitasking skills.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/6e0eebbe54de2181a4731c23cda76226.poster.avif?t=1754654978\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/6e0eebbe54de2181a4731c23cda76226.webm?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/6e0eebbe54de2181a4731c23cda76226.mp4?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run a Successful Wholesome Shipping Business</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts in the shipping industry! Improve your workflow, make the right decisions, and prove yourself as the best packaging expert in <strong>Ship, Inc.</strong>. Are you up for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/88556f4d2b38b624b82db2de8496aa25.avif?t=1754654978\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship, Inc. includes 3 different  modes (difficulty based modes) that invites all players.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8 <strong>Chill Mode:</strong> No timer; less penalties; just chill and pack stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Normal Mode:</strong> Standard timer and penalties; intended progression. Good luck on your new job!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Rush Hour Mode:</strong> You have less time to pack and more penalties for your mistakes. I hope they pay you well.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for reading, feel free to reach us on our Discord or Steam Community Forums if you have questions about the game. \ud83d\udc9b</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to step into the shoes of a packaging expert? In <strong>Ship, Inc.</strong>, you take on the role of a packaging employee at a fast-paced cargo shipment company. Your job? Sort, package, and ship parcels to their correct destinations while keeping up with the growing demands of the business.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1b99b1b2cce302b5fb340f576f391e50.poster.avif?t=1754654978\" width=790 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1b99b1b2cce302b5fb340f576f391e50.webm?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1b99b1b2cce302b5fb340f576f391e50.mp4?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How It Works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Ship, Inc., every package counts! Follow shipment orders carefully, choose the right box sizes, and ensure each package reaches its destination safely. Misplacing or damaging shipments could cost you, so be precise and efficient!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1ca9eb3742160d49f947fc1d1c607797.poster.avif?t=1754654978\" width=800 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1ca9eb3742160d49f947fc1d1c607797.webm?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/1ca9eb3742160d49f947fc1d1c607797.mp4?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Cozy &amp; Wholesome Packaging System</strong> \u2013 Select the correct box size, arrange items properly, and seal them securely before shipping.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccb <strong>Order Processing</strong> \u2013 Keep an eye on incoming orders and ship parcels correctly to maximize efficiency.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Upgrade Your Office</strong> \u2013 Earn money to improve your workspace, increase storage, and unlock better shipping tools.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Time Management Challenges</strong> \u2013 Stay on top of customer demands as you balance speed and accuracy in your shipments.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Deliver With Care</strong> \u2013 Packages must be handled properly! Fragile items require extra attention to avoid damage during transit.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Dynamic Difficulty</strong> \u2013 As you progress, new challenges and complex orders will test your multitasking skills.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/6e0eebbe54de2181a4731c23cda76226.poster.avif?t=1754654978\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/6e0eebbe54de2181a4731c23cda76226.webm?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/6e0eebbe54de2181a4731c23cda76226.mp4?t=1754654978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run a Successful Wholesome Shipping Business</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts in the shipping industry! Improve your workflow, make the right decisions, and prove yourself as the best packaging expert in <strong>Ship, Inc.</strong>. Are you up for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496000/extras/88556f4d2b38b624b82db2de8496aa25.avif?t=1754654978\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship, Inc. includes 3 different  modes (difficulty based modes) that invites all players.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8 <strong>Chill Mode:</strong> No timer; less penalties; just chill and pack stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Normal Mode:</strong> Standard timer and penalties; intended progression. Good luck on your new job!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Rush Hour Mode:</strong> You have less time to pack and more penalties for your mistakes. I hope they pay you well.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for reading, feel free to reach us on our Discord or Steam Community Forums if you have questions about the game. \ud83d\udc9b</i></p>",
